  "description": "The agent-question app's shared vectors (RFC-0014, build plan steps 3 and 10): the pure half of extensions/agent-question, run by mercury-python and mercury-nodejs against the same file. Version 3 (round 4): the app reads the question record the main flow keeps and writes nothing - the row a message becomes, the state an answer leaves and the record's transitions moved to the ask-person vectors (version 2). intake_cases pin the event the intake accepts (what it answers the main flow) or the exact 400 that refuses it. click_cases pin the request the automated click sends to the reply endpoint the link names. feed_cases pin the pages the replay and the history read over a fixed set of rows: since(seq, limit) - the rows whose sequence passed the cursor, oldest first, with the cursor to continue from - and before(seq, limit) - the rows before the cursor, newest first, with the cursor of the older page (every row when the cursor is null); more says a page was full.",
